      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْعًى مُسْكِنٌ</span></b>  <i>Abundant pasturage,</i> [<i>that causes
people to abide in it,</i>] <i>not requiring to go away;</i>
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرْبِعٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْرِلٌ</span>. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْبَحُوا مُسْكِنِينَ</span>
<i>They became in the state termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْكَنَةٌ</span>. (L, K.)

